---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StickyCTA from "../../components/StickyCTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Collaboration | Advocacy | Vision 8:28"
  description="Vision 8:28 convenes business leaders, policymakers, and community stakeholders to shape policy that is both visionary and implementable."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white">
    <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-white py-32 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,')] opacity-20"></div>
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-4xl">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
              Collective Voice.<br />Collective Power.
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Vision 8:28's advocacy strength comes from alignment — not volume. We convene business leaders, economic development professionals, higher education institutions, workforce boards, and community stakeholders to shape policy that is both visionary and implementable.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a
              href="#join"
              class="inline-block bg-[#24a4b9] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#1d8a9d] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
            >
              Join The Advocacy Network
            </a>
            <a
              href="/contact"
              class="inline-block bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors duration-200"
            >
              Host A Policy Roundtable
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Our Collaborative Model
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            Four structured approaches to turning shared priorities into actionable policy outcomes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-5 mb-5">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl flex-shrink-0">
                01
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Policy Roundtables</h3>
                <span class="text-[#24a4b9] text-sm font-semibold">Structured Convening</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Structured convenings with business executives, policymakers, and civic leaders to align on shared priorities. Roundtables produce actionable frameworks, not just conversation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-5 mb-5">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl flex-shrink-0">
                02
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Research & Position Papers</h3>
                <span class="text-[#24a4b9] text-sm font-semibold">Thought Leadership</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Data-driven white papers and thought leadership reports that influence regional decision-making. Our research shapes the narrative before legislation is drafted.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-5 mb-5">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl flex-shrink-0">
                03
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Joint Advocacy Campaigns</h3>
                <span class="text-[#24a4b9] text-sm font-semibold">Coalition Building</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Coalition-building initiatives across sectors to advance high-impact legislation. We unite diverse voices behind a single, outcome-oriented agenda.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-5 mb-5">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl flex-shrink-0">
                04
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Public-Private Strategic Forums</h3>
                <span class="text-[#24a4b9] text-sm font-semibold">Cross-Sector Alignment</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Cross-sector convenings that create shared accountability frameworks for measurable outcomes — ensuring advocacy translates directly into execution.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
              National & Regional Alignment
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
              Through structured dialogue and shared metrics, we ensure that advocacy translates into execution.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            {[
              "Economic Development Corporations",
              "Chambers of Commerce",
              "Workforce Development Boards",
              "Higher Education Institutions",
              "Municipal & State Agencies",
              "Private Sector Leaders"
            ].map(org => (
              <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-6 py-5 flex items-center gap-4 hover:shadow-sm transition-shadow duration-200">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-slate-800 font-medium">{org}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            What Our Network Is Saying
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8">
            <div class="mb-6">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#24a4b9] opacity-60" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
              "Vision 8:28 elevated our policy strategy from reactive to strategic."
            </p>
            <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Regional Economic Development Executive</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Advocacy Network Member</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8">
            <div class="mb-6">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#24a4b9] opacity-60" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
              "Their collaborative framework turned competing priorities into aligned action."
            </p>
            <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Corporate Government Affairs Director</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Policy Roundtable Participant</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="join" class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
                Join The Vision 8:28 Advocacy Network
              </h2>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
                Network members receive direct access to the policy conversations that shape regional economic development — before, during, and after legislation moves.
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10">
                {[
                  "Early access to policy briefs",
                  "Invitation-only roundtables",
                  "Legislative tracking updates",
                  "Co-branding opportunities on position papers",
                  "Access to executive briefings"
                ].map(benefit => (
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#24a4b9] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                      <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                      </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">{benefit}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                <a
                  href="/contact"
                  class="inline-block bg-[#24a4b9] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#1d8a9d] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
                >
                  Join The Advocacy Network
                </a>
                <a
                  href="/contact"
                  class="inline-block border-2 border-slate-300 text-slate-700 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200"
                >
                  Host A Policy Roundtable
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Request Advocacy Network Access</h3>
              <form class="space-y-5">
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Name</label>
                  <input type="text" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#24a4b9] focus:border-transparent transition" placeholder="Your full name" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Organization</label>
                  <input type="text" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#24a4b9] focus:border-transparent transition" placeholder="Your organization" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Email</label>
                  <input type="email" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#24a4b9] focus:border-transparent transition" placeholder="you@organization.com" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Area of Policy Interest</label>
                  <select class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#24a4b9] focus:border-transparent transition bg-white">
                    <option value="">Select a focus area</option>
                    <option>Workforce & Talent Development</option>
                    <option>Small Business & Entrepreneurship</option>
                    <option>Infrastructure & Innovation</option>
                    <option>Community Investment & Inclusive Growth</option>
                    <option>All Areas</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <button
                  type="submit"
                  class="w-full bg-[#24a4b9] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#1d8a9d] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
                >
                  Request Access
                </button>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
          The Future Is Not Written. It Is Designed.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-xl mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Vision 8:28 stands at the intersection of policy, capital, and community.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg mb-10 leading-relaxed">
          If you believe advocacy should be intelligent, collaborative, and outcome-driven — this is your seat at the table.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-block bg-[#24a4b9] text-white px-12 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#1d8a9d] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
        >
          Engage With Vision 8:28 Advocacy Today
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <StickyCTA
      title="Shape Policy. Drive Outcomes."
      description="Join the Vision 8:28 Advocacy Network and amplify your voice at the regional and national level."
      ctaText="Join The Advocacy Network"
      ctaHref="#join"
    />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
